{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3900fb0284622020","name":"Nova-Class Battlecruiser","source":{"id":"source:reference-3900fb0284622020","title":"Nova-Class Battlecruiser","revision":18764,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:41:40Z","sha256":"21c3e12cb3ffed530d3d1f4723a1d6f3b396fe51a7da5826049c14b3073a5812","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18764","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nova-Class%20Battlecruiser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3900fb0284622020","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hapes Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hapes_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:91b0af29e731ba94"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hapan Battle Dragon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hapan_Battle_Dragon","referenceId":"reference:6fe6d4351ec8d563"}," is a formidable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},", encounters with smugglers and pirates utilizing small attack craft revealed a weakness in its design. A Battle Dragon has little chance of hitting multiple ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", and it can be picked apart by wings of swift, nimble craft firing at it with concentrated fire from missiles and heavy lasers. To solve this problem, the Hapes Consortium scoured the galaxy for solid design ideas.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The resulting ",{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class Battlecruiser is deployed as a dedicated support ship for Battle Dragons, or used in small three-ship patrols to guard the borders of the Consortium. The crews of the cruisers see their duty as defense, of both their patrol routes and any ship they are assigned to guard.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["With technology and ideas stolen from numerous major shipyards, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class Battlecruiser is a functional cruiser in its own right, but truly shines as a support ship. Standard ",{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class tactics call on focusing firepower on smaller, faster enemy ships first, and placing the ship between oncoming fighter groups and escorted Battle Dragons. When working in small groups the cruisers use similar tactics, assigning two or three ",{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class ships to take the \"primary\" role as if they were a single Battle Dragon, and having all other cruisers maintain standard tactics. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class Battlecruiser Refits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nova-Class_Battlecruiser_Refits"}," upgrade the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"}," to a standard firing rate, expand its consumables to a year, and mount ",{"tag":"a","children":["Regenerating Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Regenerating_Shields","referenceId":"reference:2e77755f19ed1cf7"},", allowing its shields to gain +10 SR when the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recharge Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recharge_Shields","referenceId":"reference:d4549c92a68a5d8a"}," Action is taken. This comes at the cost of downgrading to a complement of twelve fighters. Such refitted ",{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class ships are CL 19.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Nova"]},"-Class Battlecruiser Statistics (CL 17)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"ht